        // uniform mode flag (0/1/2) selecting between box-avg downsample, Lanczos-3 upsample
        // (6x6 separable kernel, fractional taps) and box-average
        // downsample (axis-aligned window of half-extent canvas_to_src*0.5).
        // Reads three input channels (ha, oi, bb) and writes four output
