    // convention (13.5"/px). The gallery's parameters (dustSeg, grainFreq,
    // armWidth, filWarp, etc.) are tuned to 4.87"/px — sampling 2.77× coarser
    // turned fine filaments and dust segments into sub-pixel aliasing.
    // Field covered: IMG_W * 4.87 = 1280 * 4.87 = 6234" = 103.9' wide-ish
